-- Ignites
- Cyroban Grenades (3)
- Sonic Paralyzer Pistol 
-- Clone Pistol (2)
-- Sonic/Cripples/Mag Reload
-- 25%- Damage/25%- RoF

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
